      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds okay but i need more specifics on the infection part. like, if i see something weird at the incision site or if she seems off, how do i tell if it's just normal healing or if something bad is actually lurking in there? i'm worried about stuff i can't see right away.",
      "source": "evaluator"
